+2. **Failure of Standard Post-Training Quantization (PTQ):**
+   In Arm 2 (standard float fine-tuning without QAT), exporting the trained float model to 4-bit integer weights causes catastrophic greedy generation collapse: **53 of 58 turns (91.38%) diverge** from the model's own forward pass (matched only 5/58 (53/58 diverged)).
